\" src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/w750/ts/product/d6/84/ed/87bacac098e3fa78accea1f6c397d375.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"750\" /\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCấu tạo 3 lớp chắc chắn\u003c/strong\u003e giúp tối ưu thời gian giữ nhiệt\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg class=\"img-editor img-fluid\" src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/w750/ts/product/33/20/de/71306fa5e95f957bbef295dd7e9b183a.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"750\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eĐóng/mở dễ dàng\u003c/strong\u003e, chỉ với một thao tác đơn giản với nắp bật\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg class=\"img-editor img-fluid\" src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/w750/ts/product/58/3c/72/1a52b3468aca4d06bf5dbc354a5b2776.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"750\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eNắp cốc chắc chắn\u003c/strong\u003e, chống tràn tuyệt đối, an toàn khi sử dụng kể cả khi lật ngược cốc, cốc đổ\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg class=\"img-editor img-fluid\" src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/w750/ts/product/10/d1/6b/3a61ad0ad4f9691c7564c7be31da67fc.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"750\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAn toàn chuẩn Châu Âu\u003c/strong\u003e với inox 304 bền bỉ, chống ăn mòn, chống gỉ tốt\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg class=\"img-editor img-fluid\" src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/w750/ts/product/03/8a/35/9d2eb1e9f3a634403dbdfc804fe14122.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"750\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eThiết kế thông minh\u003c/strong\u003e miệng rộng thêm đá dễ dàng, vệ sinh nhanh chóng\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg class=\"img-editor img-fluid\" src=\"https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/w750/ts/product/a6/c0/60/7e63a92a39ea58f1b7a4c1c5353b8b4e.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"750\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eThỏa sức mang theo cả mùa hè trong